<title>ITALY: Verona air cargo traffic down 2.9pct in July.</title>
<headline>Verona air cargo traffic down 2.9pct in July.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Verona airport handled 486 tonnes of flown air cargo traffic in July 1997, down 2.9 percent on the same period last yuear witha drop in exports outweighing a rise in the smaller import volume, the airport authority said.</p>
<p>Ovewr the first six months the total handled showed a 6.3 percent rise with exports staging a 10.1 percent increase.</p>
<p>		  July 97   Pct change   Jan-July 97   Pct change</p>
<p>Import cargo   179	  up  3.4	1,018	 up  0.5</p>
<p>Export cargo   307	down  6.2	1,749	 up 10.1</p>
<p>Total cargo    486	down  2.9	2,767	 up  6.3</p>
<p>- Reuters Air Cargo Service Tel+ 44 171 542 7706 Fax +5017 - www.racs.com</p>
